n  - Labels Page (`/settings/labels`) - label management\n  - Settings Page (`/settings`) - workspace settings\n- **Keyboard Shortcuts**: C (create), G+I (my issues), G+N (inbox)\n- **Visual Design**: Dark mode (#0f1117), minimal, compact, purple-blue accent (#5e6ad2)\n\n### 2. tests.md (/repo/apps/LinearClone/docs/tests.md)\nContains comprehensive test specifications for:\n- **Login Page**: 10 tests covering form rendering, validation, successful/failed login, redirects\n- **Sign Up Page**: 11 tests covering form rendering, account creation, validation, existing email handling\n- **Navigation Sidebar**: 34 tests covering:\n  - Main Sidebar: workspace header, navigation links, badges, team sections, workspace section, active link highlighting\n  - SidebarCollapse: 8 tests for collapse/expand functionality with state persistence\n  - KeyboardShortcuts: 8 tests for C key (create modal) and G+I/G+N shortcuts\n- **Placeholder sections** for future tests:\n  - My Issues Page\n  - Inbox Page\n  - Team Issues Page\n  - Issue Detail Page\n  - Create Issue Modal\n  - Active Cycle Page\n  - Projects Page\n  - Project Detail Page\n  - Members Page\n  - Teams Management Page\n  - Labels Page\n  - Settings Page"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: ae251ff8668da8566 (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 28655\ntool_uses: 6\nduration_ms: 13263</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3d399d8a-f837-4f0e-875f-e0e6565056aa","uuid":"2d43ae88-6a19-42cb-a8c5-b97a00160cb9","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Find the app directory for a \"linear clone\" app in /repo/apps/. List its contents, then read AppSpec.md, docs/tests.md, and docs/plan.md if they exist. Also check for AppRevisions.md. I need the full contents of all these files.","agentId":"ae251ff8668da8566","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I found the LinearClone app directory and successfully read the files. Here's a summary of what I found:\n\n## LinearClo